metry- and phase-controlled spectra in a surface-state Andreev cavity&rdquo;</em>. Processed data are provided in <code>.csv</code> or <code>.txt</code> format, together with the corresponding raw measurement data.</p>\n<p>The STM/STS data were acquired and stored using Nanonis SPM Control Software (Generic Version 5). Scan images are provided in Nanonis <code>.sxm</code> format, STS grid measurements in binary <code>.3ds</code> format, and single-point STS spectra in ASCII format.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Greichgauer, Adrian", "affiliation": "University of Cologne", "orcid": "0000-0001-9137-6641"}, {"name": "Brede, Jens", "affiliation": "University of Cologne", "orcid": "0000-0002-4946-8160"}, {"name": "Ando, Yoichi", "affiliation": "University of Cologne", "orcid": "0000-0002-3553-3355"}], "keywords": ["Andreev bound states", "Proximity effect", "Cu(111)", "Nb(110)", "Surface states"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "arXiv:2609.28189", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "arxiv"}], "version": "1.0.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "crc1238"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22402764"}}]}}, "title": "Data for \"Imaging geometry- and phase-controlled spectra in a surface-state Andreev cavity\"", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22402765", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22402765", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22402765?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22402765", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22402765", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22402765", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22402765/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22402764", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22402764", "